{"id":"mahabharata-6-109","work":"mahabharata","part":6,"partName":"भीष्मपर्व","partNameEn":"Bhishma Parva","unit":109,"title":"नवाधिकशततमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 109 · Tenth day: Bhima among the ten warriors","summary":{"en":"Ten Kaurava warriors, including Bhagadatta, Kripa and Jayadratha, attack Bhima, who cuts their weapons and arrows apart. The Trigarta king then surrounds Bhima and Arjuna with thousands of chariots.","kn":"ಭಗದತ್ತ, ಕೃಪ, ಜಯದ್ರಥ ಮೊದಲಾದ ಹತ್ತು ಕೌರವ ಯೋಧರು ಭೀಮನ ಮೇಲೆ ದಾಳಿಮಾಡುತ್ತಾರೆ; ಭೀಮ ಅವರ ಆಯುಧ, ಬಾಣಗಳನ್ನು ಕತ್ತರಿಸುತ್ತಾನೆ. ತ್ರಿಗರ್ತರಾಜ ಸಾವಿರ ರಥಗಳಿಂದ ಭೀಮ-ಅರ್ಜುನರನ್ನು ಸುತ್ತುವರಿಯುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"भगदत्त, कृप, जयद्रथ आदि दस कौरव योद्धा भीम पर आक्रमण करते हैं और भीम उनके शस्त्र-बाण काट देते हैं। त्रिगर्त राजा हज़ारों रथों से भीम और अर्जुन को घेर लेता है।","te":"భగదత్తుడు, కృపుడు, జయద్రథుడు మొదలైన పది కౌరవ యోధులు భీమునిపై దాడి చేస్తారు; భీముడు వారి ఆయుధాలను, బాణాలను ఛేదిస్తాడు. త్రిగర్తరాజు వేల రథాలతో భీమార్జునులను చుట్టుముడతాడు.","ta":"பகதத்தன், கிருபர், ஜயத்ரதன் முதலிய பத்து கௌரவ வீரர் பீமனைத் தாக்க, அவன் அவர்களின் ஆயுதங்களையும் அம்புகளையும் வெட்டுகிறான். திரிகர்த்த மன்னன் ஆயிரக்கணக்கான தேர்களால் பீமனையும் அர்ஜுனனையும் சூழ்கிறான்.","ml":"ഭഗദത്തൻ, കൃപർ, ജയദ്രഥൻ എന്നിവരടക്കം പത്ത് കൗരവ യോദ്ധാക്കൾ ഭീമനെ ആക്രമിക്കുന്നു; ഭീമൻ അവരുടെ ആയുധങ്ങളും അമ്പുകളും മുറിച്ചുകളയുന്നു. പിന്നീട് ത്രിഗർത്ത രാജാവ് ആയിരക്കണക്കിന് രഥങ്ങളുമായി ഭീമനെയും അർജുനനെയും വളയുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 6.109; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Mon Jul 26 2021","sections":[{"title":"भीष्मवधपर्व","titleEn":"Bhishmavadha Parva (The fall of Bhishma)","verses":[{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"भगदत्तः कृपः शल्यः कृतवर्मा च सात्वतः ।\nविन्दानुविन्दावावन्त्यौ सैन्धवश्च जयद्रथः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhagadatta, Kripa, Shalya, Kritavarma of the Satvata line, Vinda and Anuvinda of Avanti, and Jayadratha the Sindhu king,"}},{"n":2,"text":"चित्रसेनो विकर्णश्च तथा दुर्मर्षणो युवा ।\nदशैते तावका योधा भीमसेनमयोधयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Chitrasena, Vikarna and the young Durmarshana: these ten warriors of yours fought Bhimasena."}},{"n":3,"text":"महत्या सेनया युक्ता नानादेशसमुत्थया ।\nभीष्मस्य समरे राजन्प्रार्थयाना महद्यशः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Joined by a great army gathered from many lands, king, they sought great glory for Bhishma in the battle."}},{"n":4,"text":"शल्यस्तु नवभिर्बाणैर्भीमसेनमताडयत् ।\nकृतवर्मा त्रिभिर्बाणैः कृपश्च नवभिः शरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Shalya struck Bhimasena with nine arrows, Kritavarma with three, and Kripa with nine."}},{"n":5,"text":"चित्रसेनो विकर्णश्च भगदत्तश्च मारिष ।\nदशभिर्दशभिर्भल्लैर्भीमसेनमताडयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Chitrasena, Vikarna and Bhagadatta, respected sir, each struck Bhimasena with ten broad arrows."}},{"n":6,"text":"सैन्धवश्च त्रिभिर्बाणैर्जत्रुदेशेऽभ्यताडयत् ।\nविन्दानुविन्दावावन्त्यौ पञ्चभिः पञ्चभिः शरैः ।\nदुर्मर्षणश्च विंशत्या पाण्डवं निशितैः शरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The Sindhu king hit him on the collarbone with three arrows; Vinda and Anuvinda of Avanti hit him with five each; and Durmarshana struck the Pandava with twenty sharp arrows."}},{"n":7,"text":"स तान्सर्वान्महाराज भ्राजमानान्पृथक्पृथक् ।\nप्रवीरान्सर्वलोकस्य धार्तराष्ट्रान्महारथान् ।\nविव्याध बहुभिर्बाणैर्भीमसेनो महाबलः ॥","meaning":{"en":"But the mighty Bhimasena, great king, pierced each of those splendid warriors, the great chariot-warriors of Dhritarashtra's side who were heroes to the whole world, with many arrows."}},{"n":8,"text":"शल्यं पञ्चाशता विद्ध्वा कृतवर्माणमष्टभिः ।\nकृपस्य सशरं चापं मध्ये चिच्छेद भारत ।\nअथैनं छिन्नधन्वानं पुनर्विव्याध पञ्चभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"He wounded Shalya with fifty and Kritavarma with eight, and, O Bharata, cut Kripa's bow with its arrow in the middle; then, as Kripa's bow was cut, he struck him again with five."}},{"n":9,"text":"विन्दानुविन्दौ च तथा त्रिभिस्त्रिभिरताडयत् ।\nदुर्मर्षणं च विंशत्या चित्रसेनं च पञ्चभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"He struck Vinda and Anuvinda with three each, Durmarshana with twenty, and Chitrasena with five."}},{"n":10,"text":"विकर्णं दशभिर्बाणैः पञ्चभिश्च जयद्रथम् ।\nविद्ध्वा भीमोऽनदद्धृष्टः सैन्धवं च पुनस्त्रिभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhima wounded Vikarna with ten arrows and Jayadratha with five, roaring boldly, and struck the Sindhu king again with three."}},{"n":11,"text":"अथान्यद्धनुरादाय गौतमो रथिनां वरः ।\nभीमं विव्याध संरब्धो दशभिर्निशितैः शरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Gautama Kripa, the best of charioteers, took another bow and angrily struck Bhima with ten sharp arrows."}},{"n":12,"text":"स विद्धो बहुभिर्बाणैस्तोत्त्रैरिव महाद्विपः ।\nततः क्रुद्धो महाबाहुर्भीमसेनः प्रतापवान् ।\nगौतमं ताडयामास शरैर्बहुभिराहवे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Pierced by many arrows, like a great elephant by goads, the mighty-armed and glorious Bhimasena grew angry and struck Kripa in the battle with many arrows."}},{"n":13,"text":"सैन्धवस्य तथाश्वांश्च सारथिं च त्रिभिः शरैः ।\nप्राहिणोन्मृत्युलोकाय कालान्तकसमद्युतिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"With three arrows, he sent the Sindhu king's horses and charioteer to the world of death, shining like Time the destroyer."}},{"n":14,"text":"हताश्वात्तु रथात्तूर्णमवप्लुत्य महारथः ।\nशरांश्चिक्षेप निशितान्भीमसेनस्य संयुगे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Leaping quickly from his chariot whose horses were slain, that great warrior hurled sharp arrows at Bhimasena in the fight."}},{"n":15,"text":"तस्य भीमो धनुर्मध्ये द्वाभ्यां चिच्छेद भारत ।\nभल्लाभ्यां भरतश्रेष्ठ सैन्धवस्य महात्मनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhima, O Bharata, cut that Sindhu king's bow in the middle with two broad arrows, best of the Bharatas."}},{"n":16,"text":"स च्छिन्नधन्वा विरथो हताश्वो हतसारथिः ।\nचित्रसेनरथं राजन्नारुरोह त्वरान्वितः ॥","meaning":{"en":"With his bow cut, chariot lost, horses and charioteer killed, he hurriedly climbed onto Chitrasena's chariot, O king."}},{"n":17,"text":"अत्यद्भुतं रणे कर्म कृतवांस्तत्र पाण्डवः ।\nमहारथाञ्शरैर्विद्ध्वा वारयित्वा महारथः ।\nविरथं सैन्धवं चक्रे सर्वलोकस्य पश्यतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The Pandava did a most wonderful deed there in the battle: piercing the great warriors with arrows and holding them back, he left the Sindhu king without a chariot as the whole world looked on."}},{"n":18,"text":"नातीव ममृषे शल्यो भीमसेनस्य विक्रमम् ।\nस संधाय शरांस्तीक्ष्णान्कर्मारपरिमार्जितान् ।\nभीमं विव्याध सप्तत्या तिष्ठ तिष्ठेति चाब्रवीत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Shalya could not at all bear Bhima's prowess. Fixing sharp arrows polished by the smith, he struck Bhima with seventy and shouted, \"Stand, stand!\""}},{"n":19,"text":"कृपश्च कृतवर्मा च भगदत्तश्च मारिष ।\nविन्दानुविन्दावावन्त्यौ चित्रसेनश्च संयुगे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Kripa, Kritavarma, Bhagadatta, respected sir, and Vinda and Anuvinda of Avanti, with Chitrasena in the fight,"}},{"n":20,"text":"दुर्मर्षणो विकर्णश्च सिन्धुराजश्च वीर्यवान् ।\nभीमं ते विव्यधुस्तूर्णं शल्यहेतोररिंदमाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Durmarshana, Vikarna and the mighty Sindhu king, these tamers of foes quickly pierced Bhima for the sake of Shalya."}},{"n":21,"text":"स तु तान्प्रतिविव्याध पञ्चभिः पञ्चभिः शरैः ।\nशल्यं विव्याध सप्तत्या पुनश्च दशभिः शरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"But Bhima struck each of them back with five arrows, wounded Shalya with seventy, and again with ten."}},{"n":22,"text":"तं शल्यो नवभिर्विद्ध्वा पुनर्विव्याध पञ्चभिः ।\nसारथिं चास्य भल्लेन गाढं विव्याध मर्मणि ॥","meaning":{"en":"Shalya pierced him with nine and then struck him again with five, and with a broad arrow deeply wounded his charioteer in a vital spot."}},{"n":23,"text":"विशोकं वीक्ष्य निर्भिन्नं भीमसेनः प्रतापवान् ।\nमद्रराजं त्रिभिर्बाणैर्बाह्वोरुरसि चार्पयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing his charioteer Vishoka pierced, the mighty Bhimasena struck the king of Madra in the arms and chest with three arrows."}},{"n":24,"text":"तथेतरान्महेष्वासांस्त्रिभिस्त्रिभिरजिह्मगैः ।\nताडयामास समरे सिंहवच्च ननाद च ॥","meaning":{"en":"He also struck the other great archers with three straight arrows each in the battle, and roared like a lion."}},{"n":25,"text":"ते हि यत्ता महेष्वासाः पाण्डवं युद्धदुर्मदम् ।\nत्रिभिस्त्रिभिरकुण्ठाग्रैर्भृशं मर्मस्वताडयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Those great archers, striving together, fiercely struck the Pandava, mad for the fight, in vital spots with three unblunted arrows each."}},{"n":26,"text":"सोऽतिविद्धो महेष्वासो भीमसेनो न विव्यथे ।\nपर्वतो वारिधाराभिर्वर्षमाणैरिवाम्बुदैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Though badly wounded, the great archer Bhimasena did not waver, like a mountain beneath clouds pouring streams of rain."}},{"n":27,"text":"शल्यं च नवभिर्बाणैर्भृशं विद्ध्वा महायशाः ।\nप्राग्ज्योतिषं शतेनाजौ राजन्विव्याध वै दृढम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The very renowned Bhima, having pierced Shalya severely with nine arrows, firmly struck Bhagadatta in the fight with a hundred, king."}},{"n":28,"text":"ततस्तु सशरं चापं सात्वतस्य महात्मनः ।\nक्षुरप्रेण सुतीक्ष्णेन चिच्छेद कृतहस्तवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then with a sharp razor-headed arrow he cut the bow and arrow of the high-souled Kritavarma, with a skilled hand."}},{"n":29,"text":"अथान्यद्धनुरादाय कृतवर्मा वृकोदरम् ।\nआजघान भ्रुवोर्मध्ये नाराचेन परंतप ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Kritavarma took another bow and struck Bhima, the wolf-bellied, between the brows with an iron arrow, O scourge of enemies."}},{"n":30,"text":"भीमस्तु समरे विद्ध्वा शल्यं नवभिरायसैः ।\nभगदत्तं त्रिभिश्चैव कृतवर्माणमष्टभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"But Bhima, having pierced Shalya with nine iron arrows, Bhagadatta with three, and Kritavarma with eight,"}},{"n":31,"text":"द्वाभ्यां द्वाभ्यां च विव्याध गौतमप्रभृतीन्रथान् ।\nते तु तं समरे राजन्विव्यधुर्निशितैः शरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"struck the chariot-warriors headed by Gautama with two arrows each. And they, O king, pierced him in the battle with sharp arrows."}},{"n":32,"text":"स तथा पीड्यमानोऽपि सर्वतस्तैर्महारथैः ।\nमत्वा तृणेन तांस्तुल्यान्विचचार गतव्यथः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Though harassed from all sides by those great warriors, he thought them no more than straw and moved about without distress."}},{"n":33,"text":"ते चापि रथिनां श्रेष्ठा भीमाय निशिताञ्शरान् ।\nप्रेषयामासुरव्यग्राः शतशोऽथ सहस्रशः ॥","meaning":{"en":"And those best of charioteers calmly sent sharp arrows at Bhima by the hundreds and thousands."}},{"n":34,"text":"तस्य शक्तिं महावेगां भगदत्तो महारथः ।\nचिक्षेप समरे वीरः स्वर्णदण्डां महाधनाम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The great warrior Bhagadatta hurled at him in battle a very swift spear with a golden shaft, of great value."}},{"n":35,"text":"तोमरं सैन्धवो राजा पट्टिशं च महाभुजः ।\nशतघ्नीं च कृपो राजञ्शरं शल्यश्च संयुगे ॥","meaning":{"en":"King Jayadratha, the mighty-armed, hurled a javelin and a spiked club, Kripa a hundred-slayer, and Shalya an arrow, in the fight."}},{"n":36,"text":"अथेतरे महेष्वासाः पञ्च पञ्च शिलीमुखान् ।\nभीमसेनं समुद्दिश्य प्रेषयामासुरोजसा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the other great archers sent five arrows each at Bhimasena with force."}},{"n":37,"text":"तोमरं स द्विधा चक्रे क्षुरप्रेणानिलात्मजः ।\nपट्टिशं च त्रिभिर्बाणैश्चिच्छेद तिलकाण्डवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The son of the Wind cut the javelin in two with a razor-headed arrow and severed the spiked club with three arrows like a sesame stalk."}},{"n":38,"text":"स बिभेद शतघ्नीं च नवभिः कङ्कपत्रिभिः ।\nमद्रराजप्रयुक्तं च शरं छित्त्वा महाबलः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The mighty Bhima also broke the hundred-slayer with nine heron-feathered arrows and, having cut the arrow shot by the king of Madra,"}},{"n":39,"text":"शक्तिं चिच्छेद सहसा भगदत्तेरितां रणे ।\nतथेतराञ्शरान्घोराञ्शरैः संनतपर्वभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"suddenly cut the spear thrown by Bhagadatta in the battle; and, glorying in the fight, he cut the other terrible arrows with straight-jointed arrows, each into three."}},{"n":40,"text":"भीमसेनो रणश्लाघी त्रिधैकैकं समाच्छिनत् ।\nतांश्च सर्वान्महेष्वासांस्त्रिभिस्त्रिभिरताडयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"And he struck all those great archers with three arrows each."}},{"n":41,"text":"ततो धनंजयस्तत्र वर्तमाने महारणे ।\nजगाम स रथेनाजौ भीमं दृष्ट्वा महारथम् ।\nनिघ्नन्तं समरे शत्रून्योधयानं च सायकैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Arjuna, while that great battle was going on, came by chariot to the field, seeing the great warrior Bhima killing enemies and fighting with his arrows."}},{"n":42,"text":"तौ तु तत्र महात्मानौ समेतौ वीक्ष्य पाण्डवौ ।\nनाशशंसुर्जयं तत्र तावकाः पुरुषर्षभ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing the two great-souled Pandavas met there, your men, O best of men, had no hope of victory."}},{"n":43,"text":"अथार्जुनो रणे भीष्मं योधयन्वै महारथम् ।\nभीष्मस्य निधनाकाङ्क्षी पुरस्कृत्य शिखण्डिनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Arjuna, fighting the great warrior Bhishma in the battle and desiring Bhishma's death, with Shikhandi in front,"}},{"n":44,"text":"आससाद रणे योधांस्तावकान्दश भारत ।\nये स्म भीमं रणे राजन्योधयन्तो व्यवस्थिताः ।\nबीभत्सुस्तानथाविध्यद्भीमस्य प्रियकाम्यया ॥","meaning":{"en":"came upon those ten warriors of yours, O Bharata, who had stood fighting Bhima in the battle. Out of a wish to please Bhima, Bibhatsu struck them with arrows."}},{"n":45,"text":"ततो दुर्योधनो राजा सुशर्माणमचोदयत् ।\nअर्जुनस्य वधार्थाय भीमसेनस्य चोभयोः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then King Duryodhana urged Susharma on to kill both Arjuna and Bhimasena."}},{"n":46,"text":"सुशर्मन्गच्छ शीघ्रं त्वं बलौघैः परिवारितः ।\nजहि पाण्डुसुतावेतौ धनंजयवृकोदरौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Susharma, go quickly, surrounded by floods of troops, and kill these two sons of Pandu, Arjuna and Bhima.\""}},{"n":47,"text":"तच्छ्रुत्वा शासनं तस्य त्रिगर्तः प्रस्थलाधिपः ।\nअभिद्रुत्य रणे भीममर्जुनं चैव धन्विनौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing his command, the Trigarta king, lord of Prasthala, rushed in the battle at the two archers Bhima and Arjuna."}},{"n":48,"text":"रथैरनेकसाहस्रैः परिवव्रे समन्ततः ।\nततः प्रववृते युद्धमर्जुनस्य परैः सह ॥","meaning":{"en":"With many thousands of chariots he surrounded them on every side. Then a fight began between Arjuna and his enemies."}}]}]}